===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₁lewdʰ-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|lede}}, {{m|enm|leode}}, from {{inh|en|ang|lēode}} {{gloss|"people, men"; plural of {{m|ang|lēod||person, man}}}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*liudiz||people}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*h₁léwdʰis||man, people}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|lede||people}}, {{cog|fy|lie||people}}, {{cog|nl|lieden||people}}, {{m|nl|lui|lui(den)|people}}, {{cog|de|Leute||people}}, {{cog|no|lyd||people}}. More at {{l|en|leod}}.

